## Notes

- Dock slots are measured from the initial zone layout on the first drag (the items are replaced by
  equally sized slots and moved into the zone container), never hard-coded; they are re-measured on
  resize, locale switch and content reflow via `ResizeObserver`.
- Thresholds are screen pixels (`ZONE_DETACH_DISTANCE = 28`, `ZONE_DOCK_DISTANCE = 8`,
  `ZONE_RELEASE_DISTANCE = 18`) and behave identically at 50 %, 100 % and 150 % zoom; the movement
  threshold reuses `--drag-threshold` (4 px).
- Motion: `--motion-panel` for the dock settle, `--motion-hover`/`--shadow`/`--card-shadow` tokens
  only; `prefers-reduced-motion` removes scale and shadow animation and the settle transition.
- German copy lives only in `locales/de.json`; `language-check` stays green.
